                                                "example_id": "fed1af9e-ec44-44ed-b323-0cb7bd28a086",
                                                "sense_id": "94a48436-e631-3957-8a2c-53fce977fe10",
                                                "text": "Long into the night had he tiraded, until finally, when Apt had refused to keep awake a moment longer, no matter what fascinating things the desert people were doing with preserving the dead […]"
